+## Result
+
+The remaining AC2 contradiction is closed. Candidate build steps now generate
+and review release-builder notices, deterministic SPDX, provenance, and the
+release-builder manifest without mutating the accepted repository metadata or
+calling the coupled repository generator. After 15/15 reproducibility and all
+four native rows pass, one coordinated staged boundary rotates the accepted
